questions.scenario:
You are debugging a production issue where a high-throughput microservice intermittently experiences thread deadlocks and massive CPU spikes under heavy write contention. The service utilizes a custom cache built on top of `ConcurrentHashMap` to execute atomic calculations during transactional processing:

java
@Service
public class PricingEngine {
    private final Map<String, BigDecimal> cache = new ConcurrentHashMap<>();

    @Transactional
    public BigDecimal computeDiscount(String tier, String promoCode) {
        return cache.computeIfAbsent(tier, key -> {
            // Triggers a secondary calculation on the same map
            return cache.computeIfAbsent(promoCode, subKey -> fetchRemoteDiscount(key, subKey));
        });
    }
}
